      "value": "I'm also having this issue except I've only ever run the game through the Meta desktop app and don't have VRChat installed on Steam at all. When I load up, I get a screen saying I have version 1471 and I need 1472 to play, but the button to Update is unclickable. I tried loading in desktop mode (again, through Meta app) thinking maybe I could click it then, no dice. Uninstalled the game, reinstalled fresh from the Meta app, still same result. Stuck on this screen.\n\nEdit: Completely restarting my PC between uninstalling and reinstalling the game got me back in (I also installed from the headset side of the Meta App, but that probably doesn't make a difference).",
