      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is an issue with the Meta PC software or your Steam installation. Version 1472 (2024.2.3p2) has been available on all platforms since last week and your platform's auto-update system should have kicked in.\n\nI recommend using Steam over the Meta PC version of VRChat, since updating usually works much smoother.\n\nAs others have recommended too, clearing your Steam cache, validating your install, uninstalling and reinstalling VRChat, or simply fully rebooting your PC may help force an update.\n\nI'll close this ticket as this is not something fixable on our side. For further questions, feel free to reach out to our user support team at https://vrch.at/support",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
